B.d5w=new A.q("scopeRowId",B.D,'priorun-0801 C1: restrict the lane population to CONTAINS-descendants of this row id (literal id or a $-token resolved via resolveFilterToken, e.g. $rowId / $selected:<table>). FAIL-CLOSED: configured-but-unresolved (token has nothing to resolve to yet, e.g. nothing currently selected) scopes to the EMPTY set, never falls back to the unscoped board \u2014 the anti-leak guarantee a per-project lens depends on. Unset (default) = today\'s unscoped behavior. Shows a "Scoped to: X \u2715" chip when resolved; the \u2715 clears the underlying $selected:<table> selection for token scopes.',B.f,null)
