B.uk=new A.q("scopeContainsType",B.D,'With `scopeRowId`: the edge-kind value meaning "contains" (default "contains").',B.f,null)
B.dfM=new A.q("limit",B.ah,'dispusab-0804: opt-in TOP-N cap \u2014 render at most N cards, applied AFTER scope, filter, live search/column filters and sort, so `limit: 3` means "the top 3 of what this view would have shown". The PREVIEW idiom: a compact strip on an overview screen beside a button that opens the full view. Unset / <= 0 renders every row (byte-identical to before); a limit larger than the row count is a no-op.',B.f,null)
