B.dl2=new A.q("uiMenuActions",B.X,'Engine-built row-menu entries by name (explorer_ui_actions.dart), each with its own engine-localized label and per-row visibility: "composeProposeToApp" (Moku scenario of a mirror-bound board \u2192 Propose to app) and "composeProposals" (mirror-bound main board \u2192 its Proposals list). Unknown names are ignored.',B.f,null)
